=TITLE DRAFT Compiler Troupe

=head1 Purpose

The B<Compiler Troupe> maintains the compiler(s) for the language itself.  

The main website for this is the L<Rakudo Website|https://rakudo.org/>.  

The B<Compiler Troupe> has a number of sub-projects, documented at
L<Issue Trackers|https://rakudo.org/issue-trackers>

=head1 Rakudo

=head2 Resources

